  "1581845216": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -220693664,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Oh. You came back. I… did not think you would.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-560583500": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -220693664,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hello. Kirby said you might visit. She was right.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1948874276": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -220693664,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It feels strange, seeing you again. Strange… but good.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1706084251": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -397466810,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Be careful out there. The world is not kind to those who are different.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Exit"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1746938625": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -397466810,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Tell Kirby I will be alright. She worries too much when she is gone.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Exit"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-997935392": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -397466810,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Thank you for stopping by. Silence feels… less heavy.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Exit"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "660694740": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 464744457,
   "children": [
    -1094871650,
    2012262378
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Tell me about yourself.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "538344663": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 464744457,
   "children": [
    1013165443
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why do you hide out here?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1094871650": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 660694740,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "There is not much to tell. I grew up in hiding. Always hiding. My memories before that are… foggy, like I was asleep for years.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1013165443": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 538344663,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…People see horns and hooves, and they panic. They do not listen, they do not ask. They just run. And maybe… maybe they should. I do not know if I was meant to exist in their world.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "roberttree"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-627546965": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 464744457,
   "children": [
    1062588946,
    743316407
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "How did you meet Kirby?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1062588946": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -627546965,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Many, many days ago. I thought she would scream when she saw me. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2012262378": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": 660694740,
   "children": [
    -953495956,
    -1475818398,
    -54479749
   ],
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It only became clearer after I ran away. That is when Kirby found me. Since then, I have just… survived.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-953495956": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2012262378,
   "children": [
    1017255556
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Do you ever get lonely?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1475818398": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2012262378,
   "children": [
    -181760643
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "How do you feel about the farm?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-54479749": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2012262378,
   "children": [
    -272295407,
    -1093770690,
    -1949897347,
    -336455035,
    1285345472
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "So, uh. Minotaur's are real, huh?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-272295407": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -54479749,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Kirby brought books about what she thinks I am... I don't think they are true.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-181760643": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1475818398,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…It is strange. Humans drinking human milk. ",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "roberttree"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1017255556": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -953495956,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yes. Loneliness is all I knew before Kirby. Even now, I feel like a shadow on the world. But when she visits… it feels like I belong for a moment.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "roberttree"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1093770690": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -54479749,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "…I do not remember much. My mind was… clouded, like I was only half-alive. But there is one face I can recall.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1949897347": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -54479749,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "A woman. Human. She had short black hair, glasses like mine, and always wore a strange white jacket. She… she was my {M}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1285345472": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -54479749,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I ran before I could learn more. By the time my mind became clear… I was already gone. All I know is that she is real, and she is out there somewhere.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "roberttree"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-336455035": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -54479749,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "She was not very nice...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "743316407": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -627546965,
   "children": [
    -1604449191,
    -596283358,
    -1485611347
   ],
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Instead, she smiled and gave me an apple. From that day on, she kept coming back",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1604449191": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 743316407,
   "children": [
    1989107183
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "She really saved you, didn’t she?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-596283358": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 743316407,
   "children": [
    1422727041
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You depend on her too much.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1485611347": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 743316407,
   "children": [
    -901866895,
    1912648990,
    671482074,
    1230532501,
    1374298107,
    56789918
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Ever thought about… getting frisky with Kirby? (Start Sharing Route)",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "conditions": [
    {
     "kind": "compareNumber",
     "type": "ConditionMathCompareIntegers",
     "title": "If Milking Save[kirbyrobertquest] = 0",
     "fields": {
      "m_Value": {
       "kind": "variable",
       "variable": {
        "scope": "global",
        "name": "kirbyrobertquest",
        "list": "Milking Save",
        "type": "number"
       }
      },
      "m_CompareTo": {
       "m_Comparison": "Equals",
       "m_CompareTo": {
        "kind": "value",
        "value": 0
       }
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "1422727041": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -596283358,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Perhaps. But if you had no one, and then found the only person who saw you as human… would you not depend on them too?",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "roberttree"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1989107183": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1604449191,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Yes. Without her, I wouldn't be alive. I owe her more than I can ever repay.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "roberttree"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-901866895": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1485611347,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…You… really ask that? Then I will answer honestly.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1912648990": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1485611347,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yes. I have thought about it. Many times. It is difficult not to. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "671482074": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1485611347,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "She walks around in that loose overall with nothing underneath, and sometimes when she bends forward her breasts almost fall free.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1230532501": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1485611347,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "They are… enormous, distracting.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1374298107": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1485611347,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…I imagine things I should not. What it would feel like if she pressed against me, if I reached out and grabbed what she always lets spill into view.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "56789918": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1485611347,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Still, I never act on it. Kirby trusts me because I keep that line. If I crossed it, I would lose her. And that is worse than any temptation.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
